---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { email, photos } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Ladle of Love"
  description="Free community luncheon on the first and third Saturdays, 11:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m., in the dining hall at 550 East Burrell Drive."
>
  <header class="bg-base-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-primary">Ladle of Love</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg">All are welcome. No charge.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-start gap-8 px-4 py-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p>
        Join us the first and third Saturdays of each month for Ladle of Love. The luncheon is in the dining hall at 550 East Burrell Drive, from 11:00 a.m. until 1:00 p.m. It started in March 2022.
      </p>
      <p>There is no charge. Free-will offerings are accepted but not expected.</p>
      <p>
        Chef Honey from Tavern on Main creates a special entree. Breads and sweets come in from Great Harvest Bread Company. Kristi Erladi from Full Plate Catering pops in from time to time with salads and baked goods.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are a local business and would like to donate the meal, email <a class="link" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Volunteer help for the luncheon is the first and third Saturdays, 10:00 a.m.–1:00 p.m. <a class="link" href="/how-to-help/">See how to help</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img src={photos.luncheon.src} alt={photos.luncheon.alt} width="910" height="638" class="w-full rounded-box" />
  </div>
</Base>
